ian ad service Yandex. The largely unregulated advertising industry that tracks Americans online treats civilians and service members mostly the sameâ€”unless there is profit in telling them apart â€”despite evidence that exposure can reveal troop deployments, unit movements, and the routines of personnel within intelligence facilities and hardened shelters where nuclear weapons are believed to be stored. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2qTKJTtIX8TLFL4XSWPi59JQVWR2mYo40-I_pe6-a4oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;vPHVVbIqTa8U7a3ajwZdddrYNO_oARA9KXOIorjh1D4ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;P8jIMaurnU6x23-kiNQW1XRNYdwfksf3PBvEmmnSK2Eƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GSy4ZKZM2OXXxQuDrY-dNX_5N8vG7aZMU4bf4yxeExcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;i4lBb4evIBWlQUMkThjJMCMhw8mWwA4_WfY6ni3tHdcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;f_JuAf5gIVuR8gsL1jVMWiYQUheCExiS-ufDqIAeSscƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5IYZRPKQSYx_PXO-2K0cbIbBnmuiw1TNdXPq7A59tLYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;c59NIrPD-SIxMH_TQ2JUjnEUIO8tGxMIGxrwh3NKcFEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;acTPopKYEYybVe5HrwGPEm-QlF1Myy4iXLL7JSi6tFoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒ